(7762787, 1286441, 67145, '<td valign="top">lol .. SO GOOD .. !! .. <br/>wide angle of dogs can be so funny .. this is no exception .. <br/>love his or her face .. <br/>wondering if those nails need trimming .. my previous dog had to be taken to the vet to have it done .. she would make a big fuss .. but my current dog just lies there and lets me do it .. they say to get the sharpest trimmers you can because if they are blunt they exert a lot of pressure on the quick and can hurt the dog .. <br/>you probably know all that . but it never hurts to say .. :)<br/>my high vote will make up for me making suggestions which can often be not appreciated . !! .. ;)<br/> <br/>OMG .. i voted .. an 8 btw .. and pressed the right arrow to go to the next photo .. then noticed the title .. ''..... the cat'' .. i didnt notice the cat subtly hidden in the shadows .. <br/>makes this even better .. what a brilliant image . <br/>if it has a black cat the photographer could be someone who''s name begins with a W .. ;)</td>', 'lol .. SO GOOD .. !! .. wide angle of dogs can be so funny .. this is no exception .. love his or her face .. wondering if those nails need trimming .. my previous dog had to be taken to the vet to have it done .. she would make a big fuss .. but my current dog just lies there and lets me do it .. they say to get the sharpest trimmers you can because if they are blunt they exert a lot of pressure on the quick and can hurt the dog .. you probably know all that . but it never hurts to say .. :)my high vote will make up for me making suggestions which can often be not appreciated . !! .. ;) OMG .. i voted .. an 8 btw .. and pressed the right arrow to go to the next photo .. then noticed the title .. ''..... the cat'' .. i didnt notice the cat subtly hidden in the shadows .. makes this even better .. what a brilliant image . if it has a black cat the photographer could be someone who''s name begins with a W .. ;)', '2024-01-30 17:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
