(7763267, 1286205, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m extremely surprised to see you took this photo with a drone .. no wonder the horse looks a bit surprised  ..!!.. lol  .. ;)<br/>ps .. congratulations on the ribbon .. : </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Ha! No. Thanks for pointing that out. Updated it to the correct equipment  :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by roz: I''m extremely surprised to see you took this photo with a drone .. no wonder the horse looks a bit surprised  ..!!.. lol  .. ;)ps .. congratulations on the ribbon .. :  Ha! No. Thanks for pointing that out. Updated it to the correct equipment  :-)', '2024-02-05 03:49:53.000000', NULL, 0),
